# Explicit integration limitations

Fresh launches, resume-latest/continue launches, and desktop/app-server thread
changes must supply exact native session identity through the launcher or
trusted native thread event. Current scope refuses to guess when absent.
A header alone is not used to rebind a launch (subagent/session race concern).
This agent did not own runtime_launch.py or desktop identity-event wiring.
No live provider verification or screenshots were authorized for this task.

